  "title": "Fox Corporation Executives to Discuss Third Quarter Fiscal 2026 Financial Results Via Webcast",
  "summary": "New York, NY and Los Angeles, CA – April 20, 2026 – Fox Corporation (Nasdaq: FOXA, FOX) will discuss third quarter fiscal 2026 financial results via a live audio webcast beginning at 8:30 a.m. ET / 5:30 a.m. PT on May 11, 2026. Results will be released at approximately 8:00 a.m. ET / 5:00 a.m. […]",
